// XFAIL: gap 4: compile type error: expected 'usize', got 'i64'
// 0.14: the iterator chains of opt_iter_map_sum, opt_iter_next and
// opt_iter_deep written with std's iterators and real closures, as the
// front end makes them: once inlined, each is the hand-written loop (no
// call, no frame slot; the vector loop where the hand loop has one).
